/*
  EmptyStateThreshold.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0119 · EmptyStateThreshold (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The count keys mirror the web source
  (components/feedback/EmptyStateThreshold.tsx) one-for-one — the default item noun and the
  auto-generated count message (with the i18next `{{threshold}}` / `{{noun}}` / `{{current}}`
  tokens preserved verbatim, since the surface interpolates them) — plus the native P4 leaf
  chrome (loading / empty / error / freshness) so the Swift sources hold no English literals. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table ("EmptyStateThreshold") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings
  without editing the shared catalog.
*/

/* --- Count copy (web `EmptyStateThreshold.tsx` `t(...)` keys) --- */
